  "description": "AI-Powered Database Development Tool for PostgreSQL/Supabase. A .NET 9.0 tool designed for AI assistants (Claude, ChatGPT) to safely build and modify database schemas in development environments. Full DDL support: CREATE, DROP, ALTER, TRUNCATE. Features parameterized queries, audit logging, and comprehensive claude.md integration guide. FOR DEVELOPMENT/SANDBOX USE ONLY.",
